00:31:06.290 --> 00:31:07.190
we were the leader.

00:31:07.190 --> 00:31:09.770
Same thing with Gartner
reports that have come out.

00:31:09.770 --> 00:31:11.270
And we're going to
continue focusing

00:31:11.270 --> 00:31:14.900
on enhancing our products,
getting feedback from you,

00:31:14.900 --> 00:31:18.590
making sure that we are working
on the right priorities.

00:31:18.590 --> 00:31:20.560
There are also a lot
of other sessions

00:31:20.560 --> 00:31:23.600
